pxpipe-fork
===========

This is a fork of pxpipe for Srinivas Pendela. It is not official teamchong
software and it is not a new company.

Upstream pxpipe
  Project:  https://github.com/teamchong/pxpipe
  Author:   Steven (https://github.com/teamchong)
  License:  MIT (see LICENSE, original copyright notice)
  Import:   tag v0.16.0, commit 9e0e0e99b4483f40e8a58036bb1f6a1a81c331e3
  Package:  the upstream npm name is pxpipe-proxy. This fork's package name
            is pxpipe-fork so the two cannot be confused.

PAKT
  Project:  https://github.com/sriinnu/clipforge-PAKT
  Package:  @sriinnu/pakt@0.10.0
  Author:   Srinivas Pendela (https://github.com/sriinnu)
  License:  MIT
  Role:     lossless structured-text compression (L1–L3) used before any
            image rendering. L4 stays off unless a caller opts in.

